  "description": "Swashbuckle.AspNetCore (10.x+) integration for Viana.Results: SwaggerGen filters that unwrap Result/ListResult/PagedResult schemas, emit RFC 9457 problem responses, support IExampleProvider<T> with [ResponseExample] attribute and global registration. For projects using AddOpenApi() directly (without Swashbuckle), see Viana.Results.OpenApi.",
